# Eastern Time (TZ=America/New_York). Weekdays only; the routes themselves
# skip non-trading days via the Alpaca calendar.
# regime-snapshot: after the opening range, once per day, never backfilled.
40 9  * * 1-5  tick regime-snapshot
# journal-sync: after the 15:55 time-stop and the close; rebuilds round trips
# from fills, persists the cache, evaluates alerts.
15 16 * * 1-5  tick journal-sync
